  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Write a program which does the following:\n\n\nDeclare a variable  **`a`**  and initialize it to the values 151515\nCompute if **`a`**  is completely divisible by both  **`7`**  and  **`5`**\nDepending on the result above - output the following to the console\n\n`The number is divisible by both 5 &amp; 7`\n`The number is not divisible by both 5 &amp; 7`\n\n\n**Note:** Use modulo operator (%). **`a % b`** gives remainder when **`a`** is divided by **`b`**.",
